## Available_externally holders: no line in any link, as for objects, and
## in each image use calls g, the kept definition, and the stub calls
## Guarded; a call with another function type there: no line either. The
## kept definition's own use gets its line.
# DEFINE: %{kept} = FileCheck %s --check-prefix=KEPT
